cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SuperTranslate in your research or teaching, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SuperTranslate: Layout-Preserving Academic PDF Translation"
abstract: >-
  Layout-preserving English-to-Chinese translation of academic PDFs. Formulas,
  figures, tables and citations are frozen and never sent to the model; prose is
  translated with a curated academic terminology corpus and refilled at the
  original coordinates; every page is audited by an object-level QA loop that
  only accepts strict improvements. Available as a self-hosted web application
  and as an Agent Skill for Claude Code / Cursor.
authors:
  - name: "SuperTranslate Contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/asimfish/super_translate"
url: "https://asimfish.github.io/super_translate/"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
version: 0.3.2
date-released: 2026-09-03
keywords:
  - pdf-translation
  - layout-preservation
  - academic-papers
  - machine-translation
  - quality-assurance
  - agent-skill
